OL,3,GNEWSAOxford Castle Quarter attractions
OL,4,Aget green light
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a virtual reality heritage
OL,7,Fattraction, a wine bar and motorsport
OL,8,Fsimulators have been approved as part
OL,9,Fof efforts to revive part of a historic
OL,10,Fcity centre site.
OL,12,FThe development at Oxford's Castle
OL,13,FQuarter would bring several long-vacant
OL,14,Funits back into use, following approval
OL,15,Ffor new signage and changes of use for
OL,16,Fa cluster of buildings off New Road.
OL,18,FThe site, centred around the 11th
OL,19,FCentury Norman castle, is home to a
OL,20,Fhotel, restaurants and visitor
OL,21,Fattractions, but a number of premises
OL,22,Fhave remained empty for several years.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
